PROCEDURE openQueryDefault :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
    OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH saldo-estoq NO-LOCK INDEXED-REPOSITION.

    return 'OK':U.
END PROCEDURE.

